{"path":"experimental/ostream_joiner/operator=","title":"std::experimental::ostream_joiner<DelimT,CharT,Traits>::operator=","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::experimental::ostream_joiner&lt;DelimT,CharT,Traits&gt;::</span>operator=","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/experimental/ostream_joiner/operator=","section":"experimental","kind":"page","summary":"","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-libfund_ts_2\" id=\"Version_1\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw1\">template</span><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span> <span class=\"kw1\">class</span> T <span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><br>ostream_joiner<span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> operator<span class=\"sy1\">=</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span> <span class=\"kw4\">const</span> T<span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> value <span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td> (1) </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-libfund-ts-2 t-mark-ts\">(library fundamentals TS v2)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-libfund_ts_2\" id=\"Version_2\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">ostream_joiner<span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> operator<span class=\"sy1\">=</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span> <span class=\"kw4\">const</span> ostream_joiner<span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> other <span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> <span class=\"kw1\">default</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td> (2) </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-libfund-ts-2 t-mark-ts\">(library fundamentals TS v2)</span> <br><span class=\"t-mark\">(implicitly declared)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-libfund_ts_2\" id=\"Version_3\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">ostream_joiner<span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> operator<span class=\"sy1\">=</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span> ostream_joiner<span class=\"sy3\">&amp;&amp;</span> other <span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> <span class=\"kw1\">default</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td> (3) </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-libfund-ts-2 t-mark-ts\">(library fundamentals TS v2)</span> <br><span class=\"t-mark\">(implicitly declared)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"t-li1\"><span class=\"t-li\">1)</span> First, if the private \"first element\" flag is <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw2\">false</span></span></code>, insert the delimiter <code>delim</code> into the output stream <code>os</code> associated with this iterator as if by <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">os <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> delim<span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></code>.</div>\n<div class=\"t-li1\"><span class=\"t-li\"></span> Then, unconditionally sets the \"first element\" flag to <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw2\">false</span></span></code>, and insert <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">value</span></code> into the output stream as if by <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">os <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> value<span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></code>.</div>\n<div class=\"t-li1\"><span class=\"t-li\"></span> Let <code>out_stream</code>, <code>delim</code>, and <code>first_element</code> denote the private stream pointer, delimiter, and \"first element\" flag members respectively. Then this function is equivalent to\n<pre data-lang=\"cpp\"><code><span class=\"kw1\">if</span> <span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"sy3\">!</span>first_element<span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"sy2\">*</span>out_stream <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> delim<span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\nfirst_element <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> <span class=\"kw2\">false</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n<span class=\"sy2\">*</span>out_stream <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> value<span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n<span class=\"kw1\">return</span> <span class=\"sy2\">*</span>this<span class=\"sy4\">;</span></code></pre></div>\n<div class=\"t-li1\"><span class=\"t-li\">2,3)</span> Implicitly declared copy/move assignment operator that copy/move assigns the private stream pointer, delimiter, and \"first element\" flag members.</div>\n<h3 id=\"Parameters\">Parameters</h3>\n<table class=\"t-par-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-par\">\n<td> value\n</td>\n<td> -\n</td>\n<td> the object to to be written to the stream\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-par\">\n<td> other\n</td>\n<td> -\n</td>\n<td> the <code>ostream_joiner</code> object to be assigned to this object\n</td></tr></table>\n<h3 id=\"Return_value\">Return value</h3>\n<p><code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"sy2\">*</span>this</span></code>.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Example\">Example</h3>\n<div class=\"t-example\">\n<pre data-lang=\"cpp\"><code><span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;experimental/iterator&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;iostream&gt;</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"kw4\">int</span> main<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n    <span class=\"kw4\">auto</span> joiner <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/experimental/ostream_joiner/make_ostream_joiner\"><span class=\"kw2807\">std::<span class=\"me2\">experimental</span><span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">make_ostream_joiner</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span><a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a>, <span class=\"st0\">\", \"</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    joiner <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"First\"</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    joiner <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"do no harm.\"</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>  <span class=\"co1\">// prefixes with the delimiter</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span></code></pre>\n<p>Output:\n</p>\n<pre data-output=\"1\"><code>First, do no harm.</code></pre> \n</div>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Parameters","id":"Parameters"},{"depth":3,"text":"Return value","id":"Return_value"},{"depth":3,"text":"Example","id":"Example"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C++ reference"},{"path":"experimental","title":"Experimental C++ Features"},{"path":"experimental/ostream_joiner","title":"std::experimental::ostream_joiner"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"std::experimental::ostream_joiner<DelimT,CharT,Traits>::operator=","children":[{"label":"Declarations","note":"3 declarations. First, if the private \"first element\" flag is false, insert the delimiter delim into the output stream os associated…"},{"label":"Parameters","note":"value, other"},{"label":"Return value","note":"*this."},{"label":"Example"}]},"standards":[],"wordCount":208,"codeBlockCount":3}
